# Plan: Golden issue

> **Status governs editing.**
> While `Status: Draft`: this plan is built interactively during `/plan` —
> the Agent asks, the Orchestrator decides. The Agent never dumps a finished
> document; it works section by section through the Q&A, proposing each
> entry via the question tool before writing it.
> Never touch anything above the `---` frontmatter delimiter: the CLI owns
> `Status`, `Locked-At`, and `Lock-Hash`.
> Once `Status: Locked` (set by `orbit neocortex plan lock`): this file is
> IMMUTABLE. Any structural change MUST go through an official Addenda
> (`/addenda`) — never direct edits. Non-structural context goes to
> `notes/` — not here.

